  "description": "Elevate your riding experience with the Quest 2 eBike, a premium urban and trail companion engineered for refined comfort with a powerful e-system. At its core is a dynamic Ananda M81 350W 48V mid-motor, delivering 100Nm of hill-crushing torque for incredibly natural power assistance and exceptional climbing ability. This is seamlessly integrated into an advanced 6061 alloy frame with internal cable routing and an integrated 48V 14ah 672Wh battery, ensuring a clean aesthetic and optimal balance. Stay connected and informed with the Ananda DF229 Bluetooth display, offering clear ride data and app compatibility.\nThe Uding DF 100mm travel fork with hydraulic lockout allows you to fine-tune your suspension for the terrain you're exploring, from smoothing out urban potholes to improving efficiency on climbs. Experience precise shifting with the latest Shimano HG200 8 speed cassette drivetrain, featuring a Shimano Altus Derailleur. Paired with an Ananda 170mm 38T narrow/wide chainset and a wide-range Shimano HG200 11-32T cassette, you'll effortlessly conquer any incline with a reliable and expansive gear range.\nStopping is taken care of with the poweful and dependable Tektro HD-M3120 hydraulic disc brakes, with 180mm front and rear rotors for consistant braking in all conditions. Rolling on quality Kenda 27.5x2.35\" tyres, the Quest 2 provides excellent stability, traction, and comfort over diverse urban and light trail surfaces. The alloy riser bars (700mm) and an adjustable A-head 80mm stem allow for a customisable and upright riding position. An enhanced comfort plus saddle and ergo rubber grips complete the package, ensuring every journey is a pleasure.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
